            "review_title": "Review at Letimo Bakery&Restaurant",
            "review_text": "David V\nNairobi, Kenya28 contributions\n0\nGreat veggie/Vegan food and excellent cakes\nJul 2017 • Family\nI was so happy to find this vegetarian restaurant just down the street from the Galliot hotel. They serve great Vietnamese veggie dishes as well as a few western dishes such as pizza and pasta. The desserts are to die for, the brownie fudge cake was orgasmic and the croissants and pain au chocolat, despite being in a plastic bag, were also great. It's not a big place with limited seating but they also do take-out if you'd rather eat in your hotel room . My kids and I ate there everyday that we were in Nha Trang!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 5, 2017",
