            "review_text": "Alushka v\n2 contributions\n0\nWanna try Vietnamese food but you're vegetarian\nNov 2016 • Solo\nI come here very often because I trust the food quality and find the music relaxing. The Vietnamese food is great but the European food and English ability lacks a bit (but It's Vietnam hello!) All their food is vegetarian/vegan. The baked goodies are amazing! Try the macaroons. I prefer to drink coffee at a different cafe.\nWritten November 9, 2016",
